<title>USA: Medical Alliance over-allotment exercised.</title>
<headline>Medical Alliance over-allotment exercised.</headline>
<dateline>IRVING, Texas 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medical Alliance Inc said on Monday that Bear Stearns &amp; Co Inc, the lead manager of its recent initial public offering, had exercised its 300,000 share over-allotment option.</p>
<p>The company, which provides services to create temporary surgical sites in physician offices, had a two million common share offering at $11 per share on October 11.</p>
<p>Equitable Securities Corp co-managed the deal.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
